  "YangsThoughts": "Now this little thing can cause some trouble. Between the speed and jump jets, the Hellion can get that Plasma Cannon wherever it’ll hurt the most, while the ER Medium Lasers give it plenty of punch against harder targets. Throw in the Nova CEWS, and it can keep the rest of the force connected while it runs circles around the enemy.",
